<title>FINLAND: SAVON SANOMAT PLANS 96 DIVIDEND FIM 3.00.</title>
<headline>SAVON SANOMAT PLANS 96 DIVIDEND FIM 3.00.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-03-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Twelve months to December 31,</p>
<p>					   (million markka unless stated)</p>
<p> Proposed dividend				 3.00 vs 2.00</p>
<p> Profit before extraordinary items	   25.4 vs 19.9</p>
<p> Earnings per share (markka)		   7.97 vs 6.60</p>
<p> Net sales					  186.8 vs 176.4</p>
<p> Operating profit				  28.1 vs 23.6</p>
<p> Operating profit before depreciation	40.4 vs 35.8</p>
<p> Depreciation					12.3 vs 12.2</p>
<p> Net financial items			 gain 2.7 vs 3.7 charge</p>
<p> Extraordinary items			gain 14.1 vs 5.0 charge</p>
<p> Profit before appropriations, taxes	 39.5 vs 14.9</p>
<p> Taxes						  3.3 vs 1.6</p>
<p> Net profit					  41.3 vs 22.0</p>
<p> Equity to assets ratio (percent)	    43.9 vs 29.8</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of Finnish publishing company is Savon Sanomat</p>
<p>Oy.</p>
